<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <title>दैनिक ब्लड शुगर एवं आहार डायरी | Daily Blood Sugar & Diet Diary</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #0288D1;
      --primary-dark: #01579B;
      --primary-light: #E1F5FE;
      --bg-main: #F4F7F9;
      --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
      --text-main: #1A202C;
      --text-muted: #5A6A80;
      --border-color: #DDE3EA;
      
      /* Distinct Soft Section Colors */
      --bf-bg: #FFF9E6;
      --bf-border: #FFE082;
      --bf-accent: #E65100;
      --bf-badge: #FFF3E0;
      
      --lunch-bg: #EBF8EE;
      --lunch-border: #A5D6A7;
      --lunch-accent: #1B5E20;
      --lunch-badge: #E8F5E9;
      
      --dinner-bg: #F1EFFE;
      --dinner-border: #C5CAE9;
      --dinner-accent: #303F9F;
      --dinner-badge: #EDE7F6;

      --danger: #D32F2F;
      --warning: #F57C00;
      --success: #2E7D32;
      --radius-sm: 8px;
      --radius-md: 14px;
      --radius-lg: 20px;
      --shadow-sm: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      --shadow-md: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      --font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Noto Sans Devanagari", Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-family);
      background-color: var(--bg-main);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.5;
      padding-bottom: 60px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    /* Header Bar */
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #01579B 0%, #0288D1 70%, #0097A7 100%);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      padding: 24px 20px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    header::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      right: -20px;
      bottom: -30px;
      width: 140px;
      height: 140px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 50%;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .header-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .app-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .header-titles h1 {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.2px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .header-titles p {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .header-tagline {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .badge-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.2px;
    }

    .badge-secure {
      background: rgba(255, 235, 59, 0.25);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 235, 59, 0.4);
      color: #FFFDE7;
    }

    /* Policy Alert */
    .immutable-notice {
      background: #FFF8E1;
      border-left: 4px solid #FFA000;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: #6D4C41;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .immutable-notice svg {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    /* Quick Stats Bar */
    .stats-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .stat-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stat-card .num {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      display: block;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .stat-card .lbl {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 4px;
      display: block;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* Log Form Card */
    .form-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 20px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    }

    .section-headline {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #EEF2F6;
    }

    .section-headline h2 {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1E293B;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    /* Date Picker Row */
    .date-row {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .date-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 220px;
    }

    .date-left label {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #334155;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .date-input {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-family: inherit;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border: 1.5px solid #CBD5E1;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      background: #FFFFFF;
      color: #1E293B;
      font-weight: 600;
      outline: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .date-input:focus {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(2, 136, 209, 0.15);
    }

    .date-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .btn-today {
      background: #E2E8F0;
      border: none;
      color: #334155;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-today:hover {
      background: #CBD5E1;
    }

    /* MEAL LOGGING SECTIONS */
    .meal-block {
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border: 1.5px solid;
      transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
    }

    .meal-block:hover {
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    /* Breakfast */
    .block-breakfast {
      background-color: var(--bf-bg);
      border-color: var(--bf-border);
    }
    .block-breakfast .meal-header {
      color: var(--bf-accent);
    }

    /* Lunch */
    .block-lunch {
      background-color: var(--lunch-bg);
      border-color: var(--lunch-border);
    }
    .block-lunch .meal-header {
      color: var(--lunch-accent);
    }

    /* Dinner */
    .block-dinner {
      background-color: var(--dinner-bg);
      border-color: var(--dinner-border);
    }
    .block-dinner .meal-header {
      color: var(--dinner-accent);
    }

    .meal-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    }

    .meal-title {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .meal-time-tag {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      border-radius: 20px;
      color: inherit;
    }

    /* Form Grids */
    .input-grid-5 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .input-grid-6 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(135px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .field-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .field-group.full-span {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .field-group label {
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #334155;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .field-unit {
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #64748B;
    }

    .field-input, .field-select, .field-textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 9px 11px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-family: inherit;
      color: #0F172A;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1.5px solid #CBD5E1;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      outline: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .field-input:focus, .field-select:focus, .field-textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(2, 136, 209, 0.15);
      background: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .field-input::placeholder, .field-textarea::placeholder {
      color: #94A3B8;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    /* Form Action Buttons */
    .form-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .btn-save-entry {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0288D1 0%, #01579B 100%);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border: none;
      padding: 15px 24px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(2, 136, 209, 0.35);
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-save-entry:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #039BE5 0%, #0277BD 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(2, 136, 209, 0.45);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-save-entry:active {
      transform: translateY(1px);
    }

    /* Share & Export Hub */
    .share-hub {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 20px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    }

    .hub-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .hub-header h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1E293B;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .share-buttons-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .btn-action {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 11px 16px;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .btn-whatsapp {
      background: #25D366;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.3);
    }
    .btn-whatsapp:hover {
      background: #20BA5A;
    }

    .btn-copy {
      background: #3B82F6;
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }
    .btn-copy:hover {
      background: #2563EB;
    }

    .btn-download {
      background: #475569;
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }
    .btn-download:hover {
      background: #334155;
    }

    .btn-print {
      background: #0D9488;
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }
    .btn-print:hover {
      background: #0F766E;
    }

    /* History Table Section */
    .history-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 20px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .history-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .history-top h3 {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1E293B;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .filter-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .search-input {
      padding: 7px 12px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      outline: none;
    }

    /* Responsive Table Wrap */
    .table-container {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      background: #FFFFFF;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      min-width: 950px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    thead {
      background: #0F172A;
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    thead th {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
      border-right: 1px solid #1E293B;
      text-align: center;
    }

    thead tr.super-header th {
      background: #1E293B;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
    }

    th.col-bf {
      background: #D97706 !important;
      color: #FFFFFF !important;
    }
    th.col-lunch {
      background: #15803D !important;
      color: #FFFFFF !important;
    }
    th.col-dinner {
      background: #4338CA !important;
      color: #FFFFFF !important;
    }

    tbody tr {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }

    tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
      background-color: #F8FAFC;
    }

    tbody tr:hover {
      background-color: #F1F5F9;
    }

    tbody td {
      padding: 10px 10px;
      color: #1E293B;
      vertical-align: middle;
      border-right: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .td-center {
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* Glucose Status Colors */
    .sugar-pill {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 2px 7px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }
    .sugar-normal {
      background: #E8F5E9;
      color: #2E7D32;
    }
    .sugar-high {
      background: #FFEBEE;
      color: #C62828;
    }
    .sugar-low {
      background: #FFF3E0;
      color: #E65100;
    }

    .insulin-tag {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0288D1;
    }

    .empty-state {
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748B;
    }

    .empty-state svg {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    /* Mobile Cards View for smaller screens if scrolled or toggled */
    .history-card-item {
      display: none;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    /* Toast Notification */
    #toast {
      visibility: hidden;
      min-width: 250px;
      background-color: #1E293B;
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 9999;
      left: 50%;
      bottom: 30px;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.3s, bottom 0.3s;
    }

    #toast.show {
      visibility: visible;
      opacity: 1;
      bottom: 40px;
    }

    /* Modal for Summary / HTML code */
    .modal-overlay {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      z-index: 1000;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 16px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
    }

    .modal-overlay.active {
      display: flex;
    }

    .modal-content {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      max-width: 650px;
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 85vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .modal-header {
      padding: 16px 20px;
      background: #F8FAFC;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .modal-header h4 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: #1E293B;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .modal-close {
      background: none;
      border: none;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: #64748B;
    }

    .modal-body {
      padding: 20px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }

    .modal-body pre {
      background: #0F172A;
      color: #E2E8F0;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      word-break: break-word;
      max-height: 380px;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .modal-footer {
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 10px;
      background: #F8FAFC;
    }

    /* Print Styles */
    @media print {
      body {
        background: #FFFFFF;
        color: #000000;
        padding-bottom: 0;
      }
      header, .form-card, .share-hub, .immutable-notice, .stats-strip, .filter-group {
        display: none !important;
      }
      .history-card {
        box-shadow: none !important;
        border: none !important;
        padding: 0 !important;
      }
      .table-container {
        border: 1px solid #000 !important;
      }
      table {
        min-width: 100% !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    
    <!-- Top Header -->
    <header>
      <div class="header-top">
        <div class="app-icon">🩸</div>
        <div class="header-titles">
          <h1>दैनिक ब्लड शुगर एवं आहार डायरी</h1>
          <p>Daily Blood Sugar & Diet Diary • Type 1 Diabetes Log</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="header-tagline">
        <span class="badge-pill">Type 1 Diabetes Care</span>
        <span class="badge-pill badge-secure">🔒 अपरिवर्तनीय सुरक्षित रिकॉर्ड (Permanent Log)</span>
        <span class="badge-pill">डॉक्टर रिपोर्ट शेयरिंग</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Strict Restriction Notice -->
    <div class="immutable-notice">
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D97706" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
        <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <strong>चिकित्सा रिकॉर्ड सुरक्षा नियम (STRICT POLICY):</strong>
        एक बार प्रविष्टि सहेजे जाने के बाद रिकॉर्ड में कोई बदलाव (Edit) या हटाना (Delete) संभव नहीं है। यह नियम आपकी सुरक्षा एवं डॉक्टर के लिए सटीक, निष्पक्ष इतिहास बनाए रखने हेतु निर्धारित है।
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Stats Bar -->
    <div class="stats-strip">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="num" id="statTotalDays">0</span>
        <span class="lbl">कुल लॉग दिन (Total Days)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="num" id="statAvgFasting">-</span>
        <span class="lbl">औसत फास्टिंग शुगर (mg/dL)</span>
